      <p begin="01:57.940" end="02:00.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yes) that morning coffee, brewed it for ya</p>
      <p begin="02:00.100" end="02:04.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yes) one touch and I brand-newed it for ya (stupid)</p>
      <p begin="02:04.290" end="02:07.620" ttm:agent="v1">Now he's thinkin' 'bout me every night, oh</p>
